
# [GEN-<n>] <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# The [GEN-<n>] prefix is filled in from your branch name automatically.
# Leave it out — type only the part from <type> onwards.
#
#   type    feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
#   scope   lower-case, optional. e.g. cxr feed embed ui web-sdk deps
#   subject imperative mood, no trailing period, whole line under 100 chars
#
# Examples
#   feat(cxr): lower unmuted-autoplay volume 10% to 1%
#   fix(feed): forward brand_context in FEED_V1 request body
#   chore(deps): bump turbo to 2.9.6
#
# Branches   <type>/GEN-<n>/<slug>   e.g. feature/GEN-10459/cxr-c8-ad-group-id
# Details    README.md#commits--branches
